55f1132dd78e9d5a8127f274c7572a932b2a01eced208c1a20c4c0a45c27722","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"For %d turns your pyrokinesis transcends your normal limits, increasing your Fire and Cold damage by %d%% and your Fire and Cold resistance penetration by %d%%.\n\t\tIn addition:\n\t\tThe cooldowns of Thermal Shield, Thermal Leech, Thermal Aura, Thermal Strike and Pyrokinesis are reset.\n\t\tThermal Aura effects will have their radius increased by 1.\n\t\tYour Thermal Shield will have 100%% absorption efficiency and will absorb twice the normal amount of damage.\n\t\tPyrokinesis will inflict Flameshock.\n\t\tThermal Leech will reduce enemy damage by %d%%.\n\t\tThermal Strike will have its secondary cold/freeze explode in radius 1.\n\t\tThe damage bonus and resistance penetration scale with your Mindpower.\n\t\tOnly one Transcendent talent may be in effect at a time.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在 %d 回合内，你的意念燃烧突破常规极限，使火焰与寒冷伤害提高 %d%%，火焰与寒冷抗性穿透提高 %d%%。\n\t\t此外：\n\t\t重置热能护盾、热能吸取、热能光环、热能打击和意念燃烧的冷却时间。\n\t\t热能光环的效果半径增加 1 格。\n\t\t热能护盾的吸收效率提高至 100%%，并可吸收通常两倍的伤害。\n\t\t意念燃烧会施加火焰冲击。\n\t\t热能吸取会使敌人造成的伤害降低 %d%%。\n\t\t热能打击的次要寒冷/冻结效果会产生半径 1 格的爆炸。\n\t\t伤害加成与抗性穿透受精神强度加成。\n\t\t同一时间只能有一个卓越技能生效。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"05825a04e66d66489572b83041e1fbdcf8ed5937149ba3ab0ba7661814000610","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5efde6132f11ce8a9747b3eec84e479b011b8d54124a3695a9bbb91e20f25a35","logical_entry_identity":"cc56d47b733b61bda3cb4d053422402cf04e16248d1148629f67b3c11dcad916","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Lord of Skulls (warrior)","source_tag":"_t","target":"骷髅王（战士）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ae9cb80655b398d6f80bb9f7f3089f28b59459d32c79924bfd590a6ff6b5adc4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5efffba099788ce2d7f4101db310261a5d9b5519c87fded2fc5cb9b5504e866d","logical_entry_identity":"6ff6ea24b96a21c842f1fbd1771c8c77971532a72cc29ce03d70f4ca04a175da","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This target has retreated to a safe place.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标被传送至安全位置。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6f50905382e773f9963612a1d3f8acdefd893c9a27c8c2370c10c99efd9d3382","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5f028af0b49a46ee8fabd696cac5726c12f48e21ee653c7ae788365905c1f552","logical_entry_identity":"1c3867aefd2fd1ad106e9ca6eae771c8854fee6d82df43ddaeaac5b15f22e06e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"flame covered greatsword","source_tag":"_t","target":"附着火焰的大剑"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"df324c8b1d3851ed1ea9692bca13a1d23b9362480c6ec7ffa6caa12220d49015","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5f035b138def634ee31ae8d53af437bfae33c2cbb5372890cfc63a7256682d67","logical_entry_identity":"5ede759e1228728908726c1efbdd9f32a4d2e58df4147a4230edb01d663ace67","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Source# #LIGHT_RED#strangles#LAST# #Target#!","source_tag":"logCombat","target":"#Source##LIGHT_RED#绞杀#LAST##Target#！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"88b71637e2fa5dc324f459987e723b261ab9386d25ecd991af47230e689ffdd6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5f03d92ec9ed578cf39211cdd5889ac9835ebd0c6b15112f62708a2808cc172e","logical_entry_identity":"f1e2cd494a8eb12ccdc7a52803bdcf39904f96c63d3de67fbc1b68b66441c0fd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Conveyance is the school of travel. It allows you to travel faster and to track others.","source_tag":"_t","target":"学习传送，使你能更快的旅行或者追踪目标。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b1b1663de3f85001cb5ef2929e3766caceba25942fff1047b6764bfe5a2ea289","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5f08c59072fb24b4b95cbacde34902f9bc60c598cca5115644de00cee2ed3ba5","logical_entry_identity":"218c101e13ecd764dc18fd98b62ce3ceeef95fd79dd7413cba544707030f8dcb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Water circles slowly on the ground around this naga's tail. Her dark tail is coiled tight, making her look short, but her calm and confident stare assure you that she will not be easily overcome. As the water begins to rise around her the air starts to shimmer, and you feel her dark eyes are penetrating into you deeper than is comfortable.","source_tag":"_t","target":"水流缓慢的围绕着这位娜迦的尾巴旋转。她黑色的尾巴蜷缩起来，使她看起来较为矮小，但是她沉着而自信的眼神让你确信她不是轻易就能被击败的。当周围的水位开始上涨，空气开始闪烁微光，你感到她漆黑的目光洞穿了你，让你很不自在。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"205af47dabfb0b0a31cbf2921c758f54ac6b1db30ea5e51acabe17a8c5226f47","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5f0ea945e797565da6459479093d93432986528f32748e946070327f8d2ed77b","logical_entry_identity":"eeab865eb0b0ff4770d4e965881f271400daf3e73bcfca766ce4e68492843010","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"tutorial","source_tag":"talent category","target":"教程"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"877e4cc78adb8fc1282c833f09844a09992184929871caa7c18983a1db98befe","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5f10eec983b39f7d741f7becf04f8dfa17c4b9c54fad436196066f38999c79c9","logical_entry_identity":"77ef3a791e11cda06a437e623c680873119cd36b7bd00f07c5a43bb00413bf58","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Can you use your magic to alter the appearance of my gear?","source_tag":"_t","target":"你能用魔法改变我装备的外形吗？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"26df0bd1f84088b79a26fe5054cc9fe8089dcf3ef9d18156d9a401501041e092","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5f211313f27134bbdbde4fddee2263ece9efe26bc937477c1318f9ddcab9dc33","logical_entry_identity":"f10a0426df68f084afd32a1cb7824e9b16a9a85a748a9feb419cd472d72adc25","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Other celestial powers.","source_tag":"_t","target":"其他天空系能力。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3564cf17415ce0cb46e67e2a6244c0616862444da812c223af7c6a7517c594a8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5f2241d9a3936175a6a8600a8d0bde1b69f5a0ddd47d2f869703ddedac145eb5","logical_entry_identity":"51c298aea44638abddc014ae1c334396a251231039e4f178d7c6e07f1e01d71e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"inflict %0.2f mind damage (range 10), gaining psi and hate equal to 10%%%% of the damage done","source_tag":"tformat","target":